# The Social Engineering window (see socialwin.c) with every model to choose from (give_techs_all): the window as it opens, the mouse
# over models of each category (the box tells what each does: the effects with their pictures, a plus in green and a minus in
# red), a click on a model (the effects and the energy numbers are worked out again, the upheaval's cost shown), on the models
# of the other categories, an effect's button (every category takes the model that brings the most of it: the overview shows the
# effect in yellow while it works), Reset (back to the models the faction began with) and Cancel (the pending models stand).
# A place in the window is (111 + x, 203 + y); the model buttons are 150 wide at x 213, 361, 511 and 657 and 73 apart in y from 242.
# Leave time after each step; the snaps take 2 s each.
